# ================================================================
# This repo tracks ONLY the JohnnieRunner Hierarchy Active Toggle tool.
# Copy Assets/Editor/JohnnieRunnerHierarchyActiveToggle.cs + Assets/Editor/Icons/
# into any Unity project's Assets/Editor folder and it works — it needs
# nothing but Unity's editor API (tested on Unity 2020.3).
# Everything else in the surrounding project is deliberately excluded.
#
# The dmxClass9 Cosmic Poro VFX system lives in its OWN separate repo:
#   Backups/dmxClass9-repo/
# It is deliberately NOT tracked here — the two stay independent.
# ================================================================

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Editor/
/Assets/Editor/*
!/Assets/Editor/JohnnieRunnerHierarchyActiveToggle.cs
!/Assets/Editor/JohnnieRunnerHierarchyActiveToggle.cs.meta
!/Assets/Editor/Icons/
!/Assets/Editor/Icons.meta

# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces: Unity plumbing, in case the include rules above
# ever get edited.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
/Library/
/Temp/
/Logs/
/Obj/
/Builds/
/UserSettings/
/Packages/
/ProjectSettings/
/CONTEXT/
/PROJECTS/
/Captures/
/Backups/
/.workbuddy/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.user
*.pidb
*.booproj
sysinfo.txt
*.apk
*.aab
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
